reStateForSourceLayerID:featureID:stateKey:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" - Remove a state key from a feature"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource\/removeFeatureStateForSourceLayerID:featureID:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" - Remove all state from a feature"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource\/resetFeatureStatesForSourceLayerID:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" - Remove all feature state from a source layer"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Related-Examples","type":"heading","text":"Related Examples"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"Predicates_and_Expressions.md","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" - Learn about style expressions"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"GeoJSON.md","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" - Working with GeoJSON data sources"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"GestureRecognizers.md","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" - Handling user interactions"}]}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestateexample"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Styling-and-Dynamic-Data","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","doc:\